    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled within a small, exclusive and highly sought-after development just off The Hill on Church Road, No. 3 Oak Hall is an exceptional three-bedroom townhouse style residence enjoying a prestigious setting only a short stroll from the heart of Malahide Village and its wealth of amenities, including the DART station. The magnificent grounds of Malahide Castle, with its scenic walking trails, playing pitches and beautiful parklands, are also close by.\n\nPresented in true turnkey condition, this beautiful home impresses from the moment you step inside. Tastefully decorated throughout, it offers a warm and welcoming atmosphere complemented by an abundance of natural light. The spacious living room is a particular feature, boasting a stylish fireplace, dual-aspect glazing, a large bay window and French doors opening directly onto the rear garden, creating a bright and inviting space for both everyday living and entertaining.\n\nThe kitchen is exceptionally well-appointed with an extensive range of fitted units and quality built-in appliances, all of which are included in the sale, comprising a fridge freezer, cooker, extractor fan, washing machine and dishwasher.\n\nUpstairs, a bright landing enhanced by a Velux roof light leads to three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with en-suite facilities. Each bedroom benefits from fitted wardrobes and double-glazed windows, ensuring comfort and practicality throughout. The upstairs is completed by modern family bathroom.\n\nA standout feature of No. 3 is its enviable south-facing rear garden, which enjoy distant views towards the Sugar Loaf mountain. Perfectly positioned to avail of everything Malahide has to offer, residents can enjoy an outstanding selection of renowned restaurants, cafés, boutique shops, schools and sporting facilities. Excellent transport links are also close at hand, including Dublin Bus services, the DART and commuter rail connections.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.80m x 1.15m\nBright entrance hall with laminate wood flooring and carpet stairs\n\nLiving Room - 6.05m x 3.52m\nSpacious living room with polished stone fireplace and feature bay window (1.40m x 1.08m), french doors to rear garden and double glazed window to front, laminate wood flooring throughout\n\nGuest WC - 1.98m x 1.39m\nLow level wc, hand wash basin, frosted window\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room - 6.05m x 3.60m\nModern fully equipped kitchen with ample floor and wall storage units, high quality intergrated appliances such as Bosch hob, Electrolux oven, Extractor, intergrated fridge freezer, Whirlpool dishwasher, Zanussi washing machine. Ample dining space, tiled flooring throuhgout\n\nGuest Wc - 1.98m x 1.39m\nUnder stairs wc, with tiled floor, low level wc and hand wash basin.\n\nLanding - 3.15m x 2.72\nCarpet landing with double glazed windows, and velux skylight\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.40m x 2.74m\nLarge principal bedroom with built in wardrobes, laminate wood flooring and double glazed window, Ensuite bathroom\n\nEnsuite - 1.88m x 1.40m\nLarge ensuite fully fittedwith walk in shower, large hand wash basin with storage, low level wc, velux skylight and tiled flooring with part tiled walls\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.90m x 2.67m\nBuilt in wardrobes, laminate wood flooring and double glazed window\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.72m x 2.40m\nBuilt in wardrobes, laminate wood flooring and double glazed window\n\nFamily Bathrooom - 2.66m x 1.83m\nFully tiled bathroom comprising bath and shower, hand wash basin, wc and heated towel rail, double glazed window and velux skylight\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Double fronted townhouse style residence</li><li>Newly decorated to walk in condition</li><li>Small prestigious residential development</li><li>Walking distance of Malahide village centre and all amenities</li><li>Quality kitchen appliances</li><li>Large south facing sun-drenched rear garden</li><li>Distant views of Sugar Loaf from the rear garden</li><li>Car parking</li><li>Gas fired central heating</ul>"
